  "feature.chest-search.name": "Where is this item? (O)",
  "feature.chest-search.description": "Shows how many you have put away in the tooltip, and opens the list of chests holding it when you press O. Only looks in your own chests and fridges. The key can be changed in config.json.",
  "feature.item-search.name": "Find an item (magnifier tab)",
  "feature.item-search.description": "A magnifier tab in the menu: type part of an item's name to see how many you have, in which chests, where to buy it today and how to make it. Only items you have already come across, shops you have been to and recipes you have learned are used.",
  "feature.crop-timer.name": "Crops on hover",
  "feature.crop-timer.description": "Rest the cursor on a crop: how many days until it can be harvested, whether it hasn't been watered today, and whether the season will end before the harvest. Also works for young fruit trees. Nothing shows anywhere else.",
  "feature.machine-timer.name": "Machines on hover",
  "feature.machine-timer.description": "Rest the cursor on a working machine: at what time or in how many days it will be done. Casks: days until the next quality. Crab pots: full tomorrow if baited. What's being made is only named once it's ready.",
  "feature.night-recap.name": "Night report",
  "feature.night-recap.description": "Beside the shipping summary, no click needed: crops ready, crops to water, crops the season will kill, machines ready, a tool waiting at Clint's. On nights with nothing shipped, the same lines come as messages on waking.",
  "feature.map-pins.name": "Map pins",
  "feature.map-pins.description": "Right-click on the map to mark a spot with a note (a good spot, a fishing place...). The note shows on hover. Click a pin to edit its note, and leave it empty to remove the pin.",

  "feature.self-update.name": "Mod updates",
  "feature.self-update.description": "When the game starts, offers the new version of Pelican Memory if there is one, with the list of changes. One click installs it and restarts the game.",

